# Prebuild output (CNG), at the project root only. The leading slash is
# load-bearing: an unanchored `ios/` / `android/` matches at *any* depth, so it
# also swallowed `modules/<name>/android/` — the hand-written native sources of
# the local Expo modules, which must be committed. Left unanchored, `main` looked
# fine and the EAS build produced an AAB with no module in it (task-325).
/ios/
/android/

# Environment
.env
.env.local

# Google Play service account (written by CI, never commit)

# Metro bundler
.metro-health-check*

# Firebase / FCM credentials — jamais dans le dépôt (public).
# `google-services.json` porte la config client Firebase et une clé d'API.
# `*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json` est le compte de service FCM v1 : il contient une
# clé privée RSA et n'a rien à faire ici — il se téléverse sur EAS et se garde
# hors du dépôt.
google-services.json
google-services-key.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
